        "@value": "The Fog on The Promenade @ The Promenade in Downtown Digby - Jun 10, 2026, 6:00PM"
      }
    ],
    "http://opengraphprotocol.org/schema/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Situated in the centre of downtown Digby, adjacent to the War Memorial, the Promenade is a lovely outdoor space to enjoy some live music right on the Digby waterfront. Lots of seating at the picnic tables or in the comfy chairs provided. If you're in town, grab some take-out or bring your own picnic and settle in!"
      }
