        "@value": "The Fog at The Mad Hatter @ The Mad Hatter  - Jun 13, 2026, 6:30PM"
      }
    ],
    "http://opengraphprotocol.org/schema/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Back at The Mad Hatter, but this one should find us on their fabulous patio right on the waters of the beautiful Annapolis River looking across towards Granville beach. Lots of outdoor seating and the sunsets are spectacular! Always a treat to play here! Reservations highly recommended! Call 902-532-2070 to grab yours!"
      }
    ],
