        "@value": "The Fog at Lazy Bear Brewing @ Lazy Bear Brewing - Jul 23, 2026, 6:00PM"
      }
    ],
    "http://opengraphprotocol.org/schema/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Join us on the Lawn at Lazy Bear! Enjoy their artisan pizza and other tasty treats, not to mention the best local craft brewery! Come early to snag a picnic table, or one of their comfy lawn chairs, pr bring your own chair or a blanket to spread out! A beautiful spot to be on a summer evening high on the hill at Smith's Cove."
      }
